# START YOUR FOOTBALL JOURNEY WITH FOOTBALL ACADEMY DUBAI

Created by LaLiga, the world’s strongest league, LaLiga Academy Dubai offers young football players across Dubai an immersive, professional football experience, with a superior methodology recognized as the gold standard in training and development globally. LaLiga Academy Dubai has elevated youth football to unprecedented professional levels.
[BOOK FREE TRIAL](https://laligaacademydubai.com)

## ADVANCED AND SPECIAL PROGRAMS at our Football Academy
Our Advanced Program is tailored for athletes aiming to excel in competitive football, refining skills and strategic understanding through rigorous training. The High Performance Center offers state-of-the-art facilities, personalized coaching, and advanced fitness regimes to optimize player development and readiness for top-tier challenges. Our Girls Program nurtures female talent in a supportive environment, focusing on skill development, teamwork, and competitive play.
[BOOK FREE TRIAL](https://laligaacademydubai.com)

#### Accessibility
Dubai Sports City is easily accessible from all major residential hubs of Dubai.

#### Qualified Coaching Roster
Our roster of coaches is UEFA certified, trained in the LaLiga methodology of teaching football, and includes former players of various levels, including Champions League participants.

#### Full-Size Indoor Pitch
We are home to Dubai’s only full-size indoor pitch, ensuring year-round training.

#### International & Local Tournaments
Our academy players regularly participate and succeed in local and international tournaments.

#### Small Class Sizes
We maintain a small player-to-coach ratio.

#### Large SportinG Community
LaLiga Academy Dubai is part of ISD Dubai Sports City, which is Dubai’s largest sporting facility.

## WHAT WE OFFER: Football Academy Dubai
#### Football Academy
Dubai's largest football academy, and the world's first LaLiga Academy for children between the ages of 3 & 17.

#### Camps & Workshops
Introduce your children to the LaLiga way of playing football, upgrade their skills on the pitch by joining one of our special camps & workshops.

#### Current Offers
Explore all the exciting offers that we are currently offering at LaLiga Academy Dubai.

#### Partner With Us
Unlock opportunities for your brand to connect with Dubai's sports and fitness enthusiasts.

